# Roll On London 2026

Join us for an epic night of skating in London with our early bird ticket offer - don't miss out, Roll On over!
Roll On London Saturday Skate Night - general release TICKET

<!-- <a src="https://www.instagram.com/we_thenc/"> Find us here</a> -->

Come join us at Big Penny Social for an epic Saturday Skate Night! Grab your early bird ticket now to secure your spot for an evening filled with music, skating, and good vibes. Don't miss out on the chance to Skate, Share and Inspire with skaters from all over the globe. 

Book your ticket today and get ready to Roll On!

